    "text": "Here, emf of the battery <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math><br /><br />The internal resistance of the battery, <math><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math><br /><br />The voltage of D. C supply = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>120</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math><br /><br />External resistance, <math><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>15.5</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math><br /><br />When the battery of emf <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math> is charged from a <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>DC</mi></math> supply of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>120</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>, the effective emf in the circular is<br /><br /><math><mi>&#949;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>120</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>112</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>V</mi></math><br /><br />The total resistance of the circuit <math><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>15.5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi></math> Current in the circuit during charging<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#949;</mi><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>112</mn><mn>16</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math><br /><br 